# Example production schedule (server local timezone: Asia/Seoul)
# Wealth scheduled jobs, including per-user Toss WTS session maintenance, are
# dispatched inside the container every minute.
#
# Legacy host Toss checker is intentionally disabled after the per-user cutover.
# Keep the script only as an emergency/manual diagnostic; do not schedule both.
# DISABLED: 55 20 * * * /usr/local/sbin/toss-session-check.sh

* * * * * /usr/bin/docker exec wealth python -m app.services.automation.dispatcher >> /var/log/wealth-automation-dispatcher.log 2>&1
